## RESIDUE (declared, not closed): a path this driver published, whose file was later modified
# The guard recognizes 'we published here' from the control directory. It cannot tell that the
# file at that path is no longer our program, because program.ac has no Python-readable receipt
# and there is no native verify-only entry. C3-C 143 also forbids overwriting a corrupted artifact.
